Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:46.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《蝙蝠侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:38.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(哥谭市)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.02,0:03:01.02,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 嗨 我要去亚道夫大饭店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Hi. I'd like to go to the Adelphi Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.19,0:03:03.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉 - 对不起 车子是我叫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - I'm sorry. This is my cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.07,0:03:05.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我先来的呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was here first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:07.70,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:10.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计程车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计程车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走路过街吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go across. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:21.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到那边去叫 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get one down the road. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:29.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 哈洛 快叫车呀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For God's sake, Harold, can we please just get a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:31.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在叫计程车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to get a...Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,方向错了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:37.48,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉米 收起来 像土观光客似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put that away. We'll look like tourists.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:38.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:40.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这我们永远叫不到车 我们到第7街再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll never get a cab. Let's cut over to Seventh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:44.33,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 第7街在那边 - 我知道方向!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seventh is that way. - I know where we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:07.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 赏一块钱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, mister. Give me a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:10.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快走 - 怎么样? 一块钱而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - How about it? One dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:13.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你聋了吗? 不会说英语?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you deaf? You don't speak English?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.51,0:04:16.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快呀! 到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.23,0:04:20.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:23.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看小孩的份上 不要叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do the kid a favor. Don't scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.25,0:04:45.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收获不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:47.38,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国运通信用卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}American Express card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:49.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"出门别忘此卡"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Don't leave home without it."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.51,0:04:52.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:57.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话 伙计 我不喜欢这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's beat it, man. I don't like it up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:04:59.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 你有恐高症?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you scared of heights?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.35,0:05:03.36,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 强尼的下场使我害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. After what happened to Johnny Gobs...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:07.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,强尼是喝醉酒从屋顶掉下去摔死的 没什么好伤心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, man, Johnny Gobs got ripped and took a walk off a roof. No big loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.03,0:05:10.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,错了 伙计 我听说的不是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, man, that ain't what I heard at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:14.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说被蝙蝠侠抓走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard that the Bat got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:18.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠? 得了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bat? Give me a break, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:21.92,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从4楼摔下去 身体里一点血也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five stories. Straight down. There wasn't no blood in the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.29,0:05:25.63,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡扯 人行道上一片红\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shit. It was all over the pavement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:32.38,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要走了 - 闭嘴 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm getting out of here, man. - Shut up, man. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:34.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根本没有蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There ain't no Bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.01,0:05:39.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该用枪打那个孩子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have turned the gun on that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:44.92,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟要不要你的钱? 大嘴给我闭上! 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want your cut of this money or not? Now shut up! Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.77,0:06:29.91,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别杀我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:31.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别杀我! 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't kill me! man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:33.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别杀我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.15,0:06:36.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不杀你 有事请你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to kill you. I want you to do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:38.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带个话给你所有朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to tell all your friends about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:40.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:43.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:05.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对全美国人而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Across this nation...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:09.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥谭市就是犯罪的代名词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the words "Gotham City" are synonymous with crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:14.19,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,街头暴力充斥 政府官员束手无策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our streets are overrun, our public officials are helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:18.37,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身为市长 我保证扫清犯罪的根源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As mayor, I promise to root out the source of this corruption...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:20.58,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包斯卡尔格里森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss Carl Grissom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:24.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并由新任地方检查官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, our new District Attorney, Harvey Dent...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:25.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈维丹特执行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will carry out that promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:27.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harvey
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:32.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:36.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 布格市长 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mayor Borg. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:40.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥谭市民们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People of Gotham City...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.05,0:07:43.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一向言简意赅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a man of few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:47.69,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过却一言九鼎 言出必行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But those words will count, and so will my actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:50.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高登局长说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police Commissioner Gordon has informed me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.31,0:07:52.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经找出那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he has targeted those businesses...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:56.11,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为黑社会的非法营业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}suspected of fronting for the syndicate in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:07:59.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这星期之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before the week is out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:02.91,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将全面大扫荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are going to knock down their doors...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:07.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直捣魔窟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and shed the light of the law on that nest of vipers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:17.25,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要大家团结 便可以建设成一个理性高尚的城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, we can make this city safe for decent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:20.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高尚的人不该住本市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decent people shouldn't live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:23.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换个地方会更快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd be happier someplace else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:25.93,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说卡尔是个铁腕硬汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty tough talk about Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:28.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你放心好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:33.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个小丑敢碰格里森一下 早就被我吊死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this clown could touch Grissom, I'd have handed him his lungs by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.61,0:08:36.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格里森要知道你我的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Grissom knew about us...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:39.78,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不会好过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he might hand you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:43.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别往脸上帖金了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't flatter yourself, angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:49.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已年迈花甲 缺了我 他控制不了本市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a tired old man. He can't run this city without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:51.79,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:55.80,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:01.93,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的毫不在乎? 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't worry about anything, do you, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:14.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:18.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:28.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 好好保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Hanging on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.21,0:09:39.80,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别说 让我猜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:44.80,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一只巨大 超级动物 像只蝙蝠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giant, menacing, supernatural form. Kind of like a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:47.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 上面怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. What are they seeing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:49.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝了通乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're drinking Drano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:51.35,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点怪异 警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a little weird, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:52.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.77,0:09:56.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要命 又是诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ. Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:59.86,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 艾哈特警官 听说蝙蝠攻击人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Lt. Eckhardt, I hear we just had us another Bat attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.90,0:10:02.70,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个月之内连续八起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what, eight sightings now in just under a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:05.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说局长下令彻查 是真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear the Commissioner's even opened a file. True?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:08.54,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 诺克 这两个人踩香蕉皮跌死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Knox. These two slipped on a banana peel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:12.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没骗你 是只巨大的蝙蝠!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, man, a giant bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:14.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:18.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后别登在报上 诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be writing this stuff in the newspaper, Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:21.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以免毁了报社的声名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll ruin your already useless reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:24.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警官 全镇的游民都吓得魂不守舍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, every punk in this town is scared stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.51,0:10:27.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道他们怎么说吗? 说他刀枪不入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what they say? They say he can't be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:29.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,专喝人血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say he drinks blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:32.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还说 - 我说你满嘴狗臭屁 诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They say... - I say you're full of shit, Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:38.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这句话可以引述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can quote me on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.15,0:10:42.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥谭市真的有只6尺蝙蝠吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a 6-foot bat in Gotham City?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.53,0:10:44.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是领警察薪水的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if so, is he on the police payroll?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:48.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扣了税以后 年薪多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if so, what's he pulling down, after taxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:19.02,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带给你的小点心 艾哈特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brought you a little snack, Eckhardt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:24.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 干嘛不去广播? - 闭嘴听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why don't you broadcast it? - Shut up and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:29.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈维丹特盯上了咱们一家前卫公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harvey Dent has been sniffing around one of our front companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:33.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的地盘 任何问题我会处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my territory. If there's a problem, I deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:37.08,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的问题也是我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your problems are our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:41.63,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只对格里森负责 不对神经病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I answer to Grissom, not to psychos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:44.97,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 艾哈特 你该为未来想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Eckhardt, you ought to think about the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:49.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你能接管? 你最好别做梦 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean when you run the show? You ain't got no future, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.97,0:11:53.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是神经加三级 格里森心里有数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an A-1 nut-boy, and Grissom knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:00.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,考虑清楚哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.65,0:12:07.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:11.41,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿意的话是可以做出明智的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can make a good decision when you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:21.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪过夜的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you been spending your nights?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:31.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不管预算如何 我要举办游行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care how deeply in debt this festival is, I want a parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.30,0:12:33.67,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有热狗 汽球 整个策划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want hot dogs, balloons, the whole schemer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:36.48,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,热热闹闹地庆祝2百周年纪念日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna celebrate this 200th anniversary proudly and publicly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.51,0:12:38.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是庆祝破产吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may be celebrating in bankruptcy court.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:43.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,债务已经25万 还没看见半个汽球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This festival's $250,000 in the red and we haven't seen one balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:46.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要把人找来 生意自然会有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fill this square with people, and the businesses will come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:50.07,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多人会怕的躲起来 市长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think a lot of people might stay away, Mayor. They're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:53.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有了格里森干地方检察官 就不用怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't be scared when you get Grissom in that courthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:55.79,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我承诺过 记得吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised that, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:01.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎吸血爵士光临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, Count Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:03.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 最近有没大脚的消息? - 嘿 诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Had any sightings of Bigfoot lately? - Hey, Knox...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:07.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的连载已被蝙蝠侠取代了 - 垃圾就该如此处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- they buried your story on the Batman. - That's what they do to garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:09.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以得普立兹新闻奖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Pulitzer Prize stuff, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:12.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诺克 有东西给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Knox. I got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:19.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好笑 獠牙下该画几滴口水的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny. You should have a little bit more gore under the fangs, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.98,0:13:21.69,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,傻屌一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.15,0:13:25.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗 长腿姊姊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:30.07,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在看你的报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm reading your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:32.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在看你的美腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm reading yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:34.49,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我是维琪瓦尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, I'm Vicki Vale.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:37.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维琪瓦尔 流行和大都会 摄影师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, photographer. Vogue, Cosmo. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.91,0:13:41.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 想拍我裸照的话 得把镜头拉长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, if you want me to pose nude, you're gonna need a long lens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:43.96,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我正在拍战争的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I was in the Corto Maltese.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.71,0:13:48.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拍那玩意会有危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A girl could get hurt doing this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:50.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么风把你吹来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:53.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来看哥谭市野生动物的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to see some of the wildlife in Gotham City.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:56.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,野生? 比方说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wildlife? Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.93,0:14:00.10,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比方说蝙蝠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like...bats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:04.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁派你来的? - 没人 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who sent you? - Nobody, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:06.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你的报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just loved your story, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:09.48,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢蝙蝠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like bats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:11.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:15.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的照片加上你的报导 保证得奖 考虑看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pictures, your words. Pulitzer Prize material. Just think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:19.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算你有远见 也是唯一相信我的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you're a visionary. You're also the only one who believes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:21.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要确凿的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need something tangible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:25.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高登有档案 他连我电话都不接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gordon's got a file on this. I can't even get him on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:27.54,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会参加布鲁斯韦恩慈善义演 他会去吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce Wayne's benefit. He'll be there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:33.19,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 只是名单上没有我 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I don't seem to be on the guest list. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:34.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:36.78,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维琪 你愿意嫁我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Vale, will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:39.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要 - 请我吃饭?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Will you buy me lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:41.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有可能 - 我食量不大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe. - I eat light.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:50.07,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.61,0:14:52.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}son of a bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.82,0:14:55.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查出艾克斯化学厂和我们有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}makes a connection with us and with Axis Chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:57.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不知后果会如可?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of damage are we looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:15:02.41,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万一被他查到了 咱们真的完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he ties us in with Axis Chemicals, we're dead and buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:04.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该立刻采取行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should move immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:07.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我建议突击该厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we break into the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.08,0:15:09.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把办公室捣烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trash the office...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:14.59,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把纪录毁掉 宣称是工业间谍干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make off with the records and say it was industrial espionage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:20.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,聪明 这么做才对 事实上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart thinking. That's the way to go. In fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.51,0:15:23.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你亲自指挥这个行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like you to handle this operation personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.85,0:15:26.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:34.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:37.78,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不介意去隔壁等吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if you'd mind waiting in the next room?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:54.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 各位 谢谢光临 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all, gentlemen. Thank you.That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.27,0:16:06.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.06,0:16:10.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可否派别人去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can we get somebody else to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.98,0:16:13.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我受不了化学味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fumes in that place...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:15.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:19.11,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次行动关系重大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an important job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:22.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要个信得过的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need someone I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:26.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的左右手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my number one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:30.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.33,0:16:33.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:37.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的幸运牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your lucky deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:50.19,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:53.73,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就要走运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your luck is about to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:16:59.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警察局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.49,0:17:01.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请接艾哈特警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me Lt. Eckhardt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:46.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要我效劳吗? 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:49.37,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 多谢你 你真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. Thank you very much. That's very nice of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:51.37,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赏你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.01,0:18:04.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚上好 小姐 - 人多了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good evening, ma'am. - A little crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:13.35,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:18.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请教布鲁斯韦恩是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you tell me which of these guys is Bruce Wayne?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.11,0:18:20.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没把握\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.15,0:18:22.49,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是得谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.28,0:18:25.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:26.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:27.49,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:54.54,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快下注!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.14,0:18:59.36,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,8点 我一丢就是8点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight. I can make that eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.90,0:19:02.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我一丢就是8点 - 请下注\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can make that eight. - Place your bets, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:04.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,局长! 高登太太 你真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commissioner! Mrs. Gordon, you look lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:07.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,局长真的有蝙蝠侠的档案?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about that rumor that Commissioner's got a file on the Batman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:08.78,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是真的吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:10.79,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诺克 没有什么蝙蝠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knox, for the ninth time, there is no Bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:11.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有的话早抓走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there were, we would find and arrest him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.99,0:19:14.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确认吗? 跟我坦白说 局长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you confirm him? Be straight with me, Commissioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.69,0:19:17.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 手气还好吧? - 糟透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you making out? - Not good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:19.54,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹特先生 我喜欢你的领带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Dent, I love that tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.67,0:19:23.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在谈飞行义警的事 你的立场如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were discussing the pros and cons of winged vigilantes. What's your stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.54,0:19:26.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诺克先生 本市的问题已经够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Knox, we have enough problems in this city...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:28.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没暇为鬼力乱神之事操心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without worrying about ghosts and goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:31.70,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我无法否认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pardon me, but that's not a denial.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:35.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪一下 我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, dear. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.56,0:19:37.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有谁要公开发表一下的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't anybody going to go on record?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:40.48,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 阁下 好棒的西装 - 无以置评\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your Honor, great suit. - No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:44.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么事? 罗勃 - 匿名情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Robert, what's up? - Anonymous tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:47.20,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳皮尔扫荡了艾克斯厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Napier's cleaning out Axis Chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:56.79,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没人告诉我? 是谁负责的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wasn't I told about this? Who's in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:58.97,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾哈特 - 真要命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eckhardt, sir. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:01.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:07.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高登先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commissioner Gordon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:14.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高登先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commissioner Gordon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.79,0:20:27.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 起居间 餐厅 还是弹药库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait. Living room, dining room, arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:29.49,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这些玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.78,0:20:31.83,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:36.83,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人道主义者 居然收集这种玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gives to all these humanitarian causes, and then collects all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:41.25,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不是为了交女人 她们喜欢他的慈善舞会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He probably does it to get chicks. They like him for his big charity balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:44.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了他的存款数字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave out his very large bankroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:47.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,越有钱 人越不值钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, remember, the more they've got, the less they're worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:50.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么他八成是全美国 价格最底的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this guy must be the most worthless guy in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.89,0:20:55.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧这个 他八成是稻草人之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out. He must have been King of the Wicker People.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.83,0:20:58.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是哪来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.56,0:21:00.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:03.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是日本的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:05.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:08.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打日本买的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I bought it in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:12.80,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是谁? - 抱歉 布鲁斯韦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - Sorry. Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.11,0:21:15.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alexander Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.81,0:21:18.83,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过你的报导 佩服之至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read your work. I like it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:20.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 捐一点吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. Can I have a grant?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:23.21,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 维琪瓦尔 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Vicki Vale. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:27.67,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 布鲁斯韦恩 - 没搞错吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bruce Wayne. - Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:28.55,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 错不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.59,0:21:31.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过你战争的作品 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen your photographs from Corto Maltese, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.53,0:21:33.55,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:35.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼光独到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got a wonderful eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.51,0:21:37.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该说是两只的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people think she has two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:42.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这栋房子好壮观 希望能有机会拍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an amazing house. I'd like to shoot it sometime if you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:45.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦恩先生 我们还需要几箱香槟 可以吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to open a few more cases of the champagne. Will that be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:47.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 请便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.71,0:21:49.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开几箱? 6箱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open, what, six? Six?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.78,0:21:53.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 6箱好 - 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Six is good. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:56.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 6箱 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great, six, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.58,0:21:58.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会在哥谭市待一阵吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, you gonna be staying in Gotham for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:03.96,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很愿意 我对亚历山大的蝙蝠报导很有兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to. I'm intrigued by Alex's giant bat stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.99,0:22:06.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, right. The Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.76,0:22:12.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以调剂一下战争的火药味 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a little bit light after the war in Corto Maltese, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.22,0:22:14.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是干哪一行的? - 哦 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you do for a living? - Well, I'm involved...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.55,0:22:18.01,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高登局长想告辞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Commissioner Gordon was compelled to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:19.27,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.35,0:22:21.69,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相当出乎意料 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very unexpectedly, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.67,0:22:25.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位恕我告退了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you two excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.31,0:22:27.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请这边走 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think perhaps this way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:28.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.57,0:22:31.07,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿福 前面还需要些酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred, they need some more wine in the front room...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.15,0:22:34.20,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔太太还需要一份菜单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and someone named Mrs. Daley needs a copy of the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:36.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 捐点钱给诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And give Knox a grant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.56,0:22:44.42,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴跟你聊 韦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice talking with you, Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.45,0:22:45.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,富人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rich...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.19,0:22:49.48,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道他们为什么怪异吗? 因为有钱经得起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why they're so odd? Because they can afford to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:51.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看这面镜子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.26,0:22:53.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该叫布鲁斯浮华的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it should be Bruce Vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.09,0:23:34.80,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 罗勃 什么事? - 匿名情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Robert, what's up? - Anonymous tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.05,0:23:37.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳皮尔扫荡了艾克斯厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Napier's cleaning out Axis Chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.51,0:23:40.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要逮了他 格里森也跑不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we could put our hands on him, we'd have Grissom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.77,0:23:44.27,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何没人告诉我? 谁负责的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wasn't I told about this? Who's in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.39,0:23:46.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾哈特 - 要命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eckhardt, sir. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.23,0:23:48.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.37,0:24:01.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看清楚了 就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Take a good look. This is the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.44,0:24:04.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(通缉犯: 杰克纳皮尔)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:06.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看个清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, get a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.63,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格杀勿论 懂我意思吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot to kill. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.09,0:24:12.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 出发吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.04,0:24:47.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们被摆道了 各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been ratted out here, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.93,0:24:49.71,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:57.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不准动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.94,0:25:17.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你 左边 你去右翼 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, left. You take the right. Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.88,0:25:19.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.51,0:25:22.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想干什么? 泄底吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you trying to do? Blow the collar?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.28,0:25:24.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿由我负责 不是卡尔格里森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in charge here, not Carl Grissom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.58,0:25:29.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是高登局长 我要抓活口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Commissioner Gordon. I want him taken alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.91,0:25:35.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重覆一次 谁开枪打伤杰克 就得对我负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat. Any man who opens fire on Jack Napier will answer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.26,0:26:24.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放我下来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.17,0:26:26.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放我下来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.11,0:26:30.86,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放我下来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.77,0:26:33.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.82,0:26:42.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.31,0:27:45.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到那边的窄道上看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if you can get up on the catwalk on that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.47,0:27:48.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你守那一边 务必小心 千万别大意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take that side. Be careful. Be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.23,0:28:04.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.49,0:28:09.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放了他 否则我就杀高登!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go, or I'll do Gordon!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.08,0:28:23.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮的行头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.73,0:28:37.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快呀 杰克 咱们走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Jack, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.61,0:28:45.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点! 杰克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.70,0:28:49.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾哈特!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eckhardt!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.28,0:28:53.29,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,替未来想一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.41,0:29:38.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的 已经到手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn it, we had him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.58,0:29:41.58,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不准动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.51,0:29:58.72,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那小子是谁? - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is this guy? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.19,0:30:02.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查明真相前 别说出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until we find out, keep a lid on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.71,0:30:30.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 如果真没蝙蝠侠 是谁把杰克丢进硫酸中?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. If there's no Bat, then who dropped this guy, Napier, into the acid?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.42,0:30:33.55,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自杀呀? 等等 我要录音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suicide? Wait, I want to get this on tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.18,0:30:35.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.39,0:30:38.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他挂了 你找到了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hung up. What have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.85,0:30:41.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是市内 这是艾克斯厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the inner city, there's Axis Chemicals...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.34,0:30:42.69,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是露面的地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and here's the sightings so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.81,0:30:45.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠可能有固定的飞行路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Batman has some kind of flight pattern or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.56,0:30:46.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.73,0:30:48.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好 这样好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is very good. I'll tell you what...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.53,0:30:51.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚先请你去吃饭 然后去散个步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tonight, first I'll take you to dinner, then we'll walk the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.53,0:30:54.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我和布鲁斯韦恩先约好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No can do. I got a date. With Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.16,0:30:55.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦恩! 韦恩! 不行!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wayne! Wayne! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.55,0:30:56.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又能怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.92,0:30:59.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是个呆头鹅 配不上你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy's a stiff. He's a rich stiff, but you could do much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.65,0:31:01.79,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的关心 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for being so concerned. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.68,0:31:17.97,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's the soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.68,0:31:20.97,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.35,0:31:24.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说汤 怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The soup. How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.60,0:31:27.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.90,0:31:34.70,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盐传过来好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you pass the salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.66,0:31:36.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.87,0:31:43.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.76,0:31:57.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我家好找吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have a hard time finding the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.01,0:32:00.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很容易 没问题 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, it was no problem. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.94,0:32:07.73,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢在这儿吃饭?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like eating in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.79,0:32:10.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.57,0:32:19.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说我以前没来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know the truth, I don't think I've ever been in this room before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.41,0:32:23.29,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想出去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.37,0:32:24.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.55,0:32:34.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁斯主人小时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was young Master Bruce...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.01,0:32:37.93,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骑着一匹小灰马跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leading his gray pony with me on its back...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.34,0:32:42.72,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像一袋老土豆 全身是泥 脚踝扭伤正在治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a sack of old potatoes, covered in mud and nursing a sprained ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.02,0:32:47.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我有生第一次也是最后一次 教他骑术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the first and last time I gave him a riding lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.27,0:32:52.19,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那一次让他一直很尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I've embarrassed him for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.86,0:32:54.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该去睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm off to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.44,0:32:58.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 不用动 我明早再收拾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, leave everything. I'll tidy up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.03,0:33:00.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 小姐 - 晚安 阿福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night, miss. - Good night, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.95,0:33:03.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 先生 - 晚安 阿福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night, sir. - Good night, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.79,0:33:11.96,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他真好 他很爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's really wonderful. He loves you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.21,0:33:15.59,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿福是很棒 连袜子都得靠他找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred's great. I couldn't find my socks without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.51,0:33:20.01,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他令我想起我爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sort of reminds me of my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.84,0:33:22.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们很亲吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you close to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.76,0:33:25.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我常和他及奶奶 一起过暑假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I used to spend summers with him and my grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.77,0:33:29.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们住在湖边 虽比不上你家 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had a house on the lake. Nothing like this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.19,0:33:32.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.36,0:33:35.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不错嘛 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That sounds nice. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.74,0:33:39.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的家人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.66,0:33:44.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实 只有阿福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, Alfred is my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.95,0:33:52.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的一切似乎跟你很不衬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This house and all this stuff really doesn't seem like you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.13,0:33:57.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些东西很像我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of it is very much me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.09,0:34:00.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.89,0:34:04.72,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,餐厅绝对不像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That dining room is definitely not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.06,0:34:06.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dining room isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.74,0:34:16.97,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(手术室)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.12,0:34:32.58,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看看结果吧 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's see how we did. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.39,0:34:54.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.56,0:34:55.73,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,镜子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.12,0:34:58.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿镜子来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.37,0:35:12.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道神经已完全毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand that the nerves were completely severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.92,0:35:20.42,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也看到我用什么工具了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see what I have to work with here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.74,0:35:45.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方到处是楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an awful lot of stairs in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.82,0:35:47.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两条腿快断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My feet are killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.58,0:35:50.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.25,0:35:59.38,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有点醉了 你却没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel a little drunk. And you're not anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.54,0:36:01.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再一杯下肚就要飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One drink and I'm flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.30,0:36:04.42,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你害怕飞行不成?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you afraid of flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.96,0:36:36.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你吗 小甜点?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you, sugar bumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.50,0:36:40.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.09,0:36:42.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.09,0:36:44.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"小甜点"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Sugar bumps."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.13,0:36:47.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.10,0:36:52.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地 你没死! 我听说你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God, you're alive! I heard you'd been...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.76,0:36:53.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烫死了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fried?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.47,0:36:56.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是这么听说的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.56,0:36:58.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了一个娘们陷害我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You set me up over a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.02,0:37:01.48,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个娘们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.27,0:37:04.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你八成是疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.87,0:37:20.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,免了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.29,0:37:23.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你命狗屎不值!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your life won't be worth spit!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.30,0:37:27.63,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经死了一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been dead once already.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.01,0:37:29.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉很自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very liberating.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.30,0:37:33.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不妨当做是一种治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should think of it as therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.27,0:37:37.14,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.81,0:37:41.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许咱俩可以谈个条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can cut a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.06,0:37:44.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.19,0:37:47.49,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克早死了 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack is dead, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.36,0:37:50.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can call me...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.36,0:37:51.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丑客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.78,0:37:54.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也看得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as you can see...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.66,0:37:56.37,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我比过去更快乐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a lot happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.44,0:38:22.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光荣的日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.62,0:39:20.25,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥谭市呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotham City.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.12,0:39:26.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一见你就笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It always brings a smile to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.65,0:39:33.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"飞行怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Winged freak...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.47,0:39:37.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人心惶惶"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}terrorizes..."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.72,0:39:43.10,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没见识过老子呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait till they get a load of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.58,0:40:01.70,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个妙计 到我家吃午饭?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got an idea. How about lunch at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.73,0:40:03.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你看些照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you some photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.20,0:40:04.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好呀 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.96,0:40:08.29,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 我不能去 我抽不出空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. No, I can't. I can't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.29,0:40:11.42,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 晚点再去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we'll do it later in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.55,0:40:12.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.92,0:40:16.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚点也不成 今天有个重要的会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't make it then, either. I've got a very important meeting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.34,0:40:18.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.28,0:40:21.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.93,0:40:24.42,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的 我只想离开几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really. I've just got to go out of town on business for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.45,0:40:27.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 等你回来再说 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, we'll do it when you get back. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.06,0:40:30.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该走了 不早了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to go. I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.17,0:40:33.86,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.66,0:40:41.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.94,0:40:45.97,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.29,0:40:49.63,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真高兴又见到你 小姐 - 彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's nice to see you again, ma'am. - Nice to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.84,0:40:54.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你们回来再说罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll talk to you guys when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.17,0:40:57.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回来? 可能要好一阵哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back, Miss Vale? We're going to be here for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.34,0:41:00.72,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.48,0:41:10.93,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.08,0:41:14.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你绝不相信我今天的遭遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll never believe what happened to me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.51,0:41:33.48,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 情况就是如此 在格里森露面之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, gentlemen, that's how it is. Until Grissom resurfaces...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.51,0:41:35.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是代理董事长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the acting president.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.35,0:41:39.11,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我决定在周年纪念日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I say, starting with this anniversary festival...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.14,0:41:41.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,攻击哥谭市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we run this city into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.44,0:41:43.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不等格里森决定?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we hear this from Grissom?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.68,0:41:45.42,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.57,0:41:48.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他奸笑个什么劲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what's with that stupid grin?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.49,0:41:52.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝对我很眷顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life's been good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.62,0:41:57.93,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们拒绝呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we say "no"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.88,0:42:01.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,东尼呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Tony...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.51,0:42:05.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人喜欢战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nobody wants a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.43,0:42:10.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生意不成仁义在 我们握手言和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can't do business, we'll just shake hands and that'll be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.46,0:42:12.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.84,0:42:15.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.82,0:42:24.21,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有电呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a live one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.70,0:42:35.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本镇今晚有的瞧罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There'll be a hot time in the old town tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.14,0:42:56.58,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,东尼一定火冒三丈罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Antoine got a little hot under the collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.61,0:42:59.29,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.45,0:43:05.37,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可曾听过一笑治百病 这句话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you ever heard of the healing power of laughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.95,0:43:15.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 给我滚! - 你们都听到了 走! 快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now get out of here! - You heard him. Let's go! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.53,0:43:17.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们想清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.43,0:43:22.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走 快 滚出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, come on. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.80,0:43:26.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.24,0:43:35.73,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.89,0:43:38.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去镜报跟踪诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to go down to the Globe, follow that reporter Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.80,0:43:40.19,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带着照相机去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.23,0:43:43.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他对蝙蝠侠知道多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what he knows about this Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.36,0:43:46.42,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有巴勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Bob...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.63,0:43:52.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,切记 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}remember, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.12,0:43:57.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的左右手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are my number one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.91,0:44:01.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.43,0:44:17.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your pals...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.89,0:44:20.20,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都不算坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're not bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.85,0:44:23.01,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不妨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.05,0:44:27.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给他们几天时间考虑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ought to give them a couple of days to think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.12,0:44:29.48,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.63,0:44:36.91,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在就杀他们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grease them now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.24,0:44:41.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.97,0:44:46.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个大奸包 洛泰里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a vicious bastard, Rotelli.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.61,0:44:49.92,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你死了活该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.79,0:44:59.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你死了活该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.50,0:45:04.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你死了活该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.33,0:45:13.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.30,0:45:17.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我快对你失去信心了 我以为咱们是一伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm losing confidence in you. I thought we were a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.55,0:45:20.14,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的私人问题吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This wouldn't be a personal issue for you, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.17,0:45:22.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只要你尽到责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want you to do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.84,0:45:24.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在尽责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.19,0:45:25.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 我在保护伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too. I'm protecting my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.51,0:45:30.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,档案中查不出任何照片或资料 他是什么人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing in these files. No photos, no histories, no nothing. Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.35,0:45:32.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,管他的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.99,0:45:37.59,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别管布鲁斯韦恩了 我要采访蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about Bruce Wayne. I'm on to Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.46,0:47:29.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们马上就要出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They should be out here any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.92,0:47:33.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我等着听他们如何解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't wait to hear the explanation for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.37,0:47:38.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here he comes, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.70,0:47:41.60,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你公证什么文件?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this affidavit you filed?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.64,0:47:43.67,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格里森把所有事业都交给你了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grissom gave you all his businesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.71,0:47:47.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格里森先生以私情委托我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Grissom asked me, as a personal favor...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.86,0:47:51.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接管他的事业 直到他回来为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to take over the operation of his businesses until he returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.50,0:47:55.07,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这倒是个大人情 你俩关系八成不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a pretty big favor. You two must have been very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.10,0:47:56.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.20,0:47:59.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小时候一起吃过牢饭?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you do a little time together as children?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.37,0:48:46.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我方的会计会查阅的 委任书是合法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our accountants are looking into it. We assure you, the affidavit is legitimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.21,0:48:53.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到墨水味 你能证明吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I smell fresh ink, guys. You can prove all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.88,0:48:55.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我胡扯些什么? 他当然能了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I asking? Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.21,0:48:58.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有证人 格里森的签名完全合法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have witnesses. Grissom's signature is perfectly legitimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.68,0:49:00.67,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是合法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is legitimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.71,0:49:03.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了 我在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it. I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.55,0:49:05.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全部看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.49,0:49:09.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他伸出死手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He reached up with his dead hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.18,0:49:11.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用鲜血签的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and signed it in his own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.86,0:49:15.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他用这支笔写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he did it...with this pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.43,0:49:19.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗 文尼 我是你宾果叔叔呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Vinnie. It's your uncle Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.43,0:49:22.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该还债了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to pay the check.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.60,0:49:29.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pen...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.27,0:49:32.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确比剑有力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is truly mightier than the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.85,0:49:50.79,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趴下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.49,0:50:12.96,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮派火拼会影响周年纪念活动吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't this gang war dampen the city's plans for the 200th anniversary festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.99,0:50:16.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活动照常举行 警方会阻止那些歹徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The festival opens. The police are gonna stop these gangsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.78,0:50:20.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹特先生 你对蝙蝠侠是黑社会组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Dent, what do you think about the theory...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.07,0:50:23.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的说法有何意见?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the mysterious Batman is a mob enforcer killing these men?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.33,0:50:25.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恕不奉告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have any comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.77,0:50:32.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.44,0:50:35.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.44,0:50:39.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人穿蝙蝠装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can somebody tell me what kind of a world we live in...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.68,0:50:42.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这成了什么世界呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where a man dressed up as a bat...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.34,0:50:45.55,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抢尽我的风头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gets all of my press?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.37,0:50:50.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本市需要通个便!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This town needs an enema!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.96,0:50:56.25,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.00,0:50:59.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我杯水好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have a glass of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.84,0:51:03.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你回来令我很安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm relieved that you're home, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.13,0:51:07.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦尔小姐来电话 她很关心呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Vale telephoned. She was rather concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.43,0:51:11.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她来过之后 好像安心多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel that there's a certain weight that lifts when she is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.37,0:51:13.79,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.90,0:51:16.21,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干脆娶她算了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why don't you marry her?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.27,0:51:20.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有这个打算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not exactly what I had in mind, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.22,0:51:24.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.82,0:51:28.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我此刻无法思考这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go on with that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.45,0:51:30.72,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If not now...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.83,0:51:34.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几时?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.66,0:51:39.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.22,0:51:46.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说杰克纳皮尔还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just found out Jack Napier's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.39,0:51:52.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接管了格里森的事业 我需要一切警方的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's running Grissom's men. I need all the information the police have on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.98,0:51:56.54,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.42,0:52:03.21,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.82,0:52:06.69,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很棒 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is great, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.72,0:52:09.01,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.00,0:52:21.20,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 市政府 诺克 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- City room, Knox. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.24,0:52:24.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 帮我查点资料好吗? - 说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want you to check something out for me. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.08,0:52:28.14,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查一下珍珠和菲力浦街 有什么不寻常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find out what's so special about the alley at Pearl and Phillips Streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.17,0:52:30.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 珍珠和菲力浦? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pearl and Phillips? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.09,0:52:31.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.09,0:52:31.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.92,0:52:33.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.38,0:52:43.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦恩先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.12,0:53:09.59,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事情这么多 时间不够用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much to do and so little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.62,0:53:11.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.22,0:53:15.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个废物是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that loss?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.26,0:53:16.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.43,0:53:19.37,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丑领带 没格调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad tie. No style.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.90,0:53:23.78,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切暂停!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the press!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.82,0:53:25.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她是什么人? - 维琪瓦尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is that? - That's Vicki Vale.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.47,0:53:28.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和诺克一起的摄影师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the photographer who's working with Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.35,0:53:30.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这姑娘有味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That girl has style.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.20,0:53:32.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖隆地咚!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus marimba!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.08,0:53:35.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么迷人的娘们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lovely beast like that running around...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.06,0:53:38.07,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个男人见了不来劲的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could put steam in a man's strides.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.10,0:53:41.08,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她和一个叫韦恩的人一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dating some guy named Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.11,0:53:43.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她快要升级了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's about to trade up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.13,0:53:47.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很难剪得齐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hard to stay inside the lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.93,0:53:52.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就要有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm about...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.26,0:53:56.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新女人了 巴勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get a new girl, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.64,0:54:01.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我此时哈的要死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm of a mind to make some mooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.19,0:54:04.25,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 电话簿 - 遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Phone book. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.78,0:54:09.55,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事情这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.82,0:54:12.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时间总觉不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and so little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.35,0:54:23.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(艾克斯化学公司)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.37,0:54:39.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你运出一百万桶了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you shipped a million of those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.34,0:54:40.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.60,0:54:45.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全运出去 咱们要改变整个规模!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ship them all! We're going to take them out a whole new door!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.38,0:54:51.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再十秒钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten seconds to transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.70,0:54:55.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五 四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five, four...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.49,0:54:59.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.07,0:55:01.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cue music.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.29,0:55:05.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cue Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.37,0:55:10.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好 当今的流行界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening. The fashion world was stunned today...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.94,0:55:15.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因模特儿甘蒂华克 和艾曼达吉勒之死而震惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the sudden deaths of models Candy Walker and Amanda Keeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.92,0:55:20.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据说死因是强烈的过敏反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause of death has been attributed to a violent allergic reaction...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.17,0:55:24.35,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当局也不排除药物致死的可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}although authorities have not ruled out the possibility of drug use.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.38,0:55:26.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.19,0:55:29.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,市长今天在揭幕式中宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And plans continue for the city's 200th birthday...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.06,0:55:32.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,周年活动按计划举行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as Mayor Borg announced today at the unveiling...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.53,0:55:34.63,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是刚送来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This just in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.03,0:55:38.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥谭市一家美容院 今天发现一连发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three mysterious deaths at a beauty parlor...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.67,0:55:46.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三起神秘死亡事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At a beauty parlor in Gotham were discovered today.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.19,0:55:48.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎么搞的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.91,0:55:51.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝琪 这种行为太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Becky, this is hardly the...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.61,0:55:54.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贝琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.35,0:55:56.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摄影机关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.21,0:55:59.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是蕾妮 在新闻摄影棚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Rene on the news floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.07,0:56:01.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一些镇静剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need some paramedics up here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.62,0:56:08.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新上市丑客产品!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New and improved Joker products!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.56,0:56:11.83,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,内含秘密成份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a new secret ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.94,0:56:13.41,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,含笑素!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smylex!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.45,0:56:15.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.07,0:56:17.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们再继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let's go over...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.88,0:56:20.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无偏见的口味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to our blind taste test.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.65,0:56:22.54,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱那个丑客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love that Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.58,0:56:25.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 从哪来的? - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's it coming from? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.79,0:56:31.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不太快乐 他使用的是X牌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He don't look happy. He's been using brand X.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.30,0:56:35.42,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有了新的丑客牌之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But with new and improved Joker brand...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.45,0:56:38.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我脸上再度展露笑容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get a grin again...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.67,0:56:40.70,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永不消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.03,0:56:43.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有美丽的古铜色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That luscious tan...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.01,0:56:45.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝红双唇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}those ruby lips...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.19,0:56:51.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有自然的发色 只有殡仪馆的人才知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and hair color so natural, only your undertaker knows for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.46,0:56:53.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂你说些什么:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.65,0:56:57.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我到哪去买这么好的货品? "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Where can I get these fine, new items? "
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.16,0:57:02.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妙处就在这 其实你已经买过了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the gag. Chances are, you bought them already!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.58,0:57:04.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱丑客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love that Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.47,0:57:06.25,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.29,0:57:09.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随时保持笑容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put on a happy face.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.11,0:57:17.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要的资料 先生 - 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The information you requested. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.42,0:57:27.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克纳皮尔 15岁 以致命武器攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Jack Napier, assault with a deadly weapon, age 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.80,0:57:30.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"心理测试结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Results of psychological profile...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.26,0:57:35.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心智失常 智慧极高 情绪极度不稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}violent mood swings, highly intelligent, emotionally unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.56,0:57:39.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,性格取向包括科学 化学和艺术"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aptitudes include science, chemistry, and art."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.99,0:57:42.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,化学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.15,0:57:52.27,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 阿福 我们去购物 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alfred, let's go shopping. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.39,0:57:59.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(化妆品带来恐慌)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.43,0:58:06.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又有六人死亡 然而丑客的致命武器 仍无线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six new deaths, with no clues as to the Joker's deadly weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.06,0:58:08.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下毒的货品有哪些?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what is the pattern?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.56,0:58:12.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,食物 酒精 美容及卫生产品?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foods, alcohol, or beauty and hygiene products?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.20,0:58:16.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,古龙水 漱口水 腋下除臭剂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cologne, mouthwash, underarm deodorant?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.22,0:58:20.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最糟的是 找不出固定的模式来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or worse yet, there may be no pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.20,0:58:24.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方继续搜索哥谭市各个购物中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The search goes on through Gotham's shopping nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.58,0:58:29.71,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活动照计划举行 即使要我用猎枪 也在所不惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are going to have a festival if I have to get a shotgun to get people there myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.74,0:58:33.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听清楚了吗? 活动照常举行!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you hear the words coming out of my mouth? The festival is on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.53,0:58:37.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你马上去查出那个疯子 用的是什么毒药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you find out what this madman is poisoning us with.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.29,0:58:39.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快去 懂了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And fast. Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.43,0:58:43.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在研究 我需要各方面的支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're working on it. I need all the help I can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.80,0:58:49.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁斯 嗨 我是维琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce, hi. It's Vicki.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.89,0:58:52.73,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我可能晚十分钟才能到博物馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, but I'm gonna be 10 minutes late to the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.76,0:58:55.58,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见面再谈 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you when I get there. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.32,0:59:03.58,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 是瓦尔小姐的口信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, a message from Miss Vale.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.62,0:59:06.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会迟到十分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll be 10 minutes late in meeting you at the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.88,0:59:10.08,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 谢谢你 等一下 阿福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, fine, thank you. Wait a minute, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.11,0:59:12.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天没有约她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not meeting her today.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.26,0:59:26.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 你去哪呀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.14,0:59:31.41,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去创作艺术 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy's going to make some art, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.14,1:00:07.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 韦恩先生的桌位?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Mr. Wayne's table?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.88,1:00:10.41,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还没到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. He hasn't arrived yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.45,1:00:12.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,桌子已摆好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a table waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.46,1:00:20.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.47,1:00:41.73,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦尔小姐 这是刚送到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Vale, this just arrived for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.33,1:01:00.86,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(马上戴上去)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.72,1:01:45.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.47,1:01:48.86,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来扩展一下见识 劳伦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's broaden our minds. Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.33,1:02:11.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刮个胡子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give him a shave.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.50,1:02:14.93,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泰伦斯 画笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terence, brush.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.78,1:02:23.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(丑客在此)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.26,1:03:10.49,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一元钞票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one-dollar bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.32,1:03:15.85,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.89,1:03:19.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我蛮喜欢这一幅的 巴勃 别戳破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kind of like this one, Bob. Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.24,1:03:36.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以摘下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can take that off now, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.50,1:03:42.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很漂亮 很有古典美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're beautiful in an old-fashioned kind of way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.37,1:03:46.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有办法让你更现代化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm sure we can make you more today.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.63,1:03:51.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的手提箱吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that your portfolio?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.51,1:03:56.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我约了人来看我作品的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm meeting someone who wants to see my work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.31,1:03:59.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.35,1:04:00.33,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.66,1:04:01.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.20,1:04:03.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.34,1:04:05.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,废物废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crap...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.74,1:04:10.21,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是好作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's good work.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.03,1:04:16.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骷髅 尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The skulls, the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.16,1:04:21.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被你一拍就很惹眼 艺术我虽不懂 我很喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give it such a glow. I don't know if it's art, but I like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.71,1:04:24.67,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我告诉你 我的想法吧 美人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you what I'm thinking about, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.70,1:04:26.72,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一天正在洗澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in the bath one day...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.76,1:04:30.72,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,突然发觉 自己天生就是个伟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I realized why I was destined for greatness.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.75,1:04:34.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道一般人多注重外表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how concerned people are about appearances.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.71,1:04:37.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个人迷人 这个人很丑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is attractive, that is not.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.60,1:04:42.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那一切都过去了 我现在的一切是别人梦想不到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is all behind me. I now do what other people only dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.34,1:04:45.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我创作艺术 直到有人死为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make art. Until someone dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.60,1:04:47.29,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.11,1:04:52.92,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是世界第一个全自动化杀人艺术家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the world's first fully-functioning homicidal artist.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.32,1:04:56.97,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.83,1:05:00.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的照片印在一元钞票上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My face on the one-dollar bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.37,1:05:04.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.88,1:05:06.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的表情像吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like I'm joking?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.85,1:05:08.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.88,1:05:10.80,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.84,1:05:15.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能和平凡人去比 我们是艺术家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We mustn't compare ourselves to regular people. We're artists.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.71,1:05:19.02,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比方说 我拿一幅作品跟你挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For instance, let me challenge you with a little piece I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.05,1:05:21.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴勃 爱莉雪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob. Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.85,1:05:24.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你用照片纪录我的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will take pictures and record my work.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.60,1:05:29.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我加入前卫艺术之列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will join me in the avant-garde of the new aesthetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.36,1:05:33.27,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 你说我可以看你修改画的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, you said I could watch you improve the paintings.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.30,1:05:37.21,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出了点问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.49,1:05:39.93,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她干嘛戴面具?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is she wearing a mask?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.96,1:05:42.33,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实只是张草图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's just a sketch, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.37,1:05:46.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱莉雪 坐下 告诉她你为何戴面具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alicia, sit down. Show the lady why you wear the mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.04,1:05:50.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 瓦尔小姐 她和我有共同的人生哲学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Miss Vale, Alicia's been made over in line with my new philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.49,1:05:52.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以她和我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now, like me...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.13,1:05:55.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是幅活动艺术品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she is a living work of art.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.93,1:06:02.58,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是毕卡索 不过你会喜欢吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no Picasso, but do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.02,1:06:05.19,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.23,1:06:08.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我帮什么忙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.43,1:06:11.19,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唱首歌 跳支舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little song, a little dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.22,1:06:13.91,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠的头吊在绳子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Batman's head on a lance.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.95,1:06:16.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 你知道多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, what do you know about...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.85,1:06:20.08,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对他一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know anything about Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.11,1:06:21.96,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.00,1:06:25.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱俩热呼一下如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how about a little "you and me"?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.17,1:06:28.63,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.67,1:06:30.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我是双鱼宫的 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I was a Pisces. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.87,1:06:33.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们交合一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make up. Have a little...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.91,1:06:36.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闻闻我的小牡丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whiff of my posy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.52,1:06:43.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.85,1:06:45.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我快要溶化了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm melting!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.02,1:06:50.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我快要溶化了! 救命呀! 我快要溶化了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm melting! Help me! I'm melting!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.57,1:06:58.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boo.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.55,1:07:14.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.10,1:07:26.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他哪来的好玩意?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does he get those wonderful toys?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.98,1:07:32.21,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 上车 - 哪一辆?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get in the car. - Which one?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.44,1:08:58.25,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.92,1:09:14.60,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盾甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.98,1:09:41.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你多重?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much do you weigh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.19,1:09:43.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,108磅吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 108, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.83,1:09:53.60,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.51,1:10:05.97,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看见我腰带上的东西吗? 抓住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See that thing on my belt? Grab it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.00,1:10:08.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何 别放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you do, don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.19,1:10:23.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.49,1:10:25.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.34,1:10:27.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查一下皮夹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check his wallet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.78,1:10:30.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 - 那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait a minute. - What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.54,1:10:34.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是胄甲 他终究还是个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of body armor. He's human after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.79,1:10:37.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面具脱掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take off the mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.05,1:10:43.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot her!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.24,1:11:48.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盾甲开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields open.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.51,1:12:14.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不只108磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weigh a little more than 108.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.71,1:12:17.70,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的? - 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.85,1:12:22.83,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.80,1:12:52.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.17,1:14:14.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.48,1:14:24.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bats.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.31,1:14:27.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生存能力很强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're great survivors.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.26,1:14:55.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是什么玩意? - 警方搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is all this? - The police have got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.71,1:14:58.14,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们以为只有一种产品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're looking for one product.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.18,1:15:01.91,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丑客在上百种货品中下毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Joker's tainted hundreds of chemicals at the source.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.52,1:15:06.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整批货都会有毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then whole shipments of products would be poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.26,1:15:09.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'd all be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.18,1:15:10.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.94,1:15:15.20,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成份混合后毒药才会生效 喷发水单独不起作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The poison only works when components are mixed. Hairspray won't do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.23,1:15:21.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但若和香水 唇膏混合 就会有毒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But hairspray mixed with lipstick and perfume will be toxic, and untraceable.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.31,1:15:24.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you figure this out?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.29,1:15:31.60,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个拿去报社\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that to the press.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.96,1:15:34.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么做有点困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might have some trouble with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.26,1:15:39.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多人认为 你和丑客一样危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of people think you're as dangerous as the Joker.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.64,1:15:41.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是丧心病狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.51,1:15:45.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也有人这么说你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people say the same thing about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.23,1:15:47.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What people?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.52,1:15:51.54,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面对现实吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I mean, let's face it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.07,1:15:55.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你并非正常人 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not exactly normal. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.99,1:15:58.49,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也不算个正常世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not exactly a normal world, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.52,1:16:00.41,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何带我来此?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.45,1:16:04.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你大可自己送去报社的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have sent that stuff to the press yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.58,1:16:06.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.00,1:16:10.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拥有我想要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is something else you have that I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.03,1:16:11.68,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.23,1:16:36.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他把底片拿走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took the film.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.24,1:16:40.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.91,1:16:44.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪了? 还好吧? 要我过去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been? Are you all right? Do you want me to come on over?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.48,1:16:47.01,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要了 亚历山大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Allie.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.20,1:16:52.25,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我现在送新闻来 赶得上晚间版吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I bring something to you, can we make the evening edition?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.28,1:16:54.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还来得及 好爆吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just barely. Is it hot?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.96,1:16:57.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 保证大爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's real hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.16,1:16:58.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.47,1:17:01.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 校对! - 是的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Copy! - Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.44,1:17:14.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,避免下列的合用情形:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avoid the following combinations:
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.02,1:17:19.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除臭剂不能与婴儿粉 喷发水和唇膏并用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deodorants with baby powder, hairspray, and lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.19,1:17:23.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安全产品在哥谭市上空 大量空投\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Safe products are flying in as Gotham City goes on a forced fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.69,1:17:27.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,市民对这位蝙蝠侠 不知如何看待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all of Gotham is wondering what to make of Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.07,1:17:29.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是友还是敌?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friend or foe?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.37,1:17:33.27,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我眼中长出一根刺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have given a name to my pain...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.83,1:17:36.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it is Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.84,1:17:44.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要对抗痛苦首需力量 巴勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must possess strength to inflict pain, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.59,1:17:47.35,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有只飞鼠待宰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a flying mouse to kill...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.38,1:17:50.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要磨爪以待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I want to clean my claws.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.90,1:17:57.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦尔小姐又来电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Miss Vale called again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.94,1:18:00.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你目前的行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dare I suggest that your present course of action...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.43,1:18:03.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只会强化她的决心?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}might simply strengthen her resolve?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.91,1:18:06.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很机巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is quite tenacious.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.08,1:18:08.41,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.45,1:18:14.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我直言 也很特别 不妨考虑对她说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I may say so, quite special. Perhaps you could try telling her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.59,1:18:25.49,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.60,1:18:32.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.90,1:18:40.79,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以进去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.12,1:18:52.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a nice apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.00,1:18:56.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空间也好大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of space.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.96,1:19:03.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I came over to...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.17,1:19:06.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 澄清几件事的 - 你自以为是什么!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- clear a few things... - I don't know who you think you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.25,1:19:08.10,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你伤了我 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You hurt me. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.14,1:19:12.93,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不断打电话给你 你却一直骗我! 骗我说要出城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I called you and I called you. And you lied! You lied about leaving town.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.96,1:19:15.27,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我告诉你原因吧 - 我告诉你好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me tell you why. - Let me tell you!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.30,1:19:17.02,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你邀我吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You invited me out, we went to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.06,1:19:19.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为彼此很投缘 我相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we felt something. And I trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.20,1:19:21.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你睡觉 我不信自己这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I even slept with you. I can't believe I did that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.27,1:19:25.78,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你却连个电话也不回 你八成是个变态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you wouldn't return my calls. You must be some kind of jerk.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.82,1:19:31.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好女孩 我好喜欢你 不过你先闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a real nice girl and I like you a lot, but right now, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.16,1:19:33.97,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有话要说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have something I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.17,1:19:46.11,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道人的性格是多变的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how people have different sides to their personality?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.30,1:19:49.40,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.80,1:19:54.35,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不得不过另一种生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a person will have to actually lead a different life.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.38,1:19:56.69,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天 你结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, you're married.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.72,1:19:59.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not married.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.65,1:20:07.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.36,1:20:11.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的生活很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my life is really...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.79,1:20:15.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}complex.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.21,1:20:23.54,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 你听着 你知道正常人一起床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, listen. You know how a normal person gets up and...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.57,1:20:26.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就下楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}goes downstairs...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.20,1:20:28.72,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃早饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and eats breakfast...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.76,1:20:31.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟家人吻别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and kisses somebody good-bye, and goes to...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.54,1:20:36.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去上班 你懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a job and, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.59,1:20:38.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.32,1:20:39.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不懂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.35,1:20:43.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.28,1:20:49.59,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维琪 我要说的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vicki, what I'm trying to tell you is...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.36,1:20:52.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.66,1:20:56.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 告诉我无妨 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can tell me. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.54,1:21:02.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I'm trying to tell you is...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.51,1:21:04.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a ...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.50,1:21:08.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我马上回来 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll be right back. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.14,1:21:19.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.80,1:21:27.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你家真美 空间好大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice place you got here. Lots of space.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.93,1:21:31.73,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维琪 咱们得谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vicki, we really should have a talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.93,1:21:34.55,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真气人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.10,1:21:37.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们吃过饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were having dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.94,1:21:41.41,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一向在美女面前一把罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a man doing well with a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.78,1:21:45.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你却一个抱歉也不说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And without so much as an apology...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.46,1:21:49.08,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就跟那个小瘪三走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you ran off with that sideshow phony.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.58,1:21:55.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Vic...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.96,1:22:00.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最近发生了悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've recently had a tragedy in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.16,1:22:01.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱莉雪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alicia...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.75,1:22:05.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跳窗自杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}threw herself out of the window.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.12,1:22:07.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.93,1:22:10.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.76,1:22:14.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞翁失马焉知非福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can't make an omelet without breaking some eggs.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.32,1:22:27.29,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦尔小姐呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Ms. Vale...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.65,1:22:30.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,窝里还有只公鸡呀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}another rooster in the hen-house?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.03,1:22:36.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直令我伤心欲绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take thy beak from out my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.92,1:22:41.38,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.50,1:22:45.93,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁斯韦恩 对吗? ?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce Wayne, n'est-ce pas?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.01,1:22:49.73,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大部份时候是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.72,1:22:57.48,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.35,1:23:03.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说给你听吧 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you about this guy I know, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.65,1:23:07.61,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下流 龌龊 专门害人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mean kid. Bad seed. Hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.64,1:23:11.41,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经喜欢上他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like him already.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.87,1:23:15.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道问题在那吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what the problem was?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.49,1:23:17.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他短路 疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got sloppy. You know, crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.93,1:23:23.38,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经成不了气候了 满肚子烂肠烂肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He started to lose it. He had a head full of bad wiring, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.41,1:23:26.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脑袋已经报销了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't keep it straight up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.21,1:23:29.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was the kind of guy who...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.55,1:23:34.19,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不见棺材不流泪的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}couldn't hear the train until it was 2 feet from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.77,1:23:41.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道他的下场吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what happened to this guy, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.32,1:23:45.02,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.73,1:23:47.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他犯了错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.19,1:23:53.20,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来就发了疯! 你也想发疯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he ended up with his lights out! Now you want to get nuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.23,1:23:56.03,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧! 大伙一起疯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let's get nuts!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.07,1:23:58.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me something, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.75,1:24:03.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可曾在月光下和魔鬼共舞过?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever dance with the devil in the pale moonlight?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.25,1:24:04.54,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.58,1:24:07.55,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我经常这样问每一个枪下鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always ask that of all my prey.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.71,1:24:11.72,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是喜欢听那种声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just like the sound of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.93,1:24:18.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要随便挑人的针眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never rub another man's rhubarb.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.56,1:24:29.70,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么每次找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it every time we got company...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.19,1:24:32.67,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总是杀出程咬金来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somebody always gets in the way?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.71,1:24:35.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要独处一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll need a moment alone, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.53,1:24:41.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是笑在脸上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm only laughing on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.58,1:24:44.92,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,内心痛苦无比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My smile is just skin-deep.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.46,1:24:47.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但愿你看得透我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could see inside...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.87,1:24:50.59,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心在哭泣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.63,1:24:56.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会陪我痛哭一场的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might join me for a weep.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.04,1:25:40.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说了你也不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't believe it. You really wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.92,1:25:47.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你乐得去享受 我却到处找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While you were out entertaining, I've been here finding out about your street corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.21,1:25:48.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vale
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.43,1:25:51.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你朋友完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think your friend Wayne is really screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.79,1:25:54.60,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有更精彩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More good news.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.63,1:25:57.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.06,1:26:01.44,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(汤玛斯韦恩被害 儿子幸免)
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.47,1:26:03.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.61,1:26:06.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他父母在那被谋害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His parents were murdered in that alley.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.93,1:26:11.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他才会去那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why he went there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.45,1:26:16.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他当场目睹一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor kid watched the whole thing happen in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.65,1:26:19.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧他脸上的表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the look on the face.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.08,1:26:22.96,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和在市政府时一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the same in front of City Hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.00,1:26:29.20,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种事对孩子的影响会有多大?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you suppose something like this does to a kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.54,1:26:31.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vale
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.34,1:26:34.70,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别太感性了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get personal!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.29,1:26:47.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.19,1:26:49.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父母的档案弄到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get the file on my parents?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.93,1:26:52.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全在你桌上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on your table, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.56,1:26:55.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.33,1:27:04.09,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想些什么 阿福?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's on your mind, Alfred?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.13,1:27:08.55,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想在余年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no wish to fill my few remaining years...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.58,1:27:11.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再为朋友的死伤神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}grieving for the loss of old friends...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.14,1:27:18.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者朋友的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or their sons.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.07,1:27:40.25,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两百周年纪念活动 无限延期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 200th anniversary birthday gala has been indefinitely postponed.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.28,1:27:43.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们无力保证大众的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We simply cannot guarantee public safety...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.37,1:27:44.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是丑客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joker here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.54,1:27:46.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有干扰 通知人去修\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got interference. Call the OB unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.79,1:27:49.92,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们说了些丑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you fellows have said some pretty mean things...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.95,1:27:52.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of which were true...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.38,1:27:55.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由那个魔头 格里森口中说出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under that fiend, Boss Grissom.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.35,1:27:58.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个贼 也是恐怖份子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a thief and a terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.26,1:28:02.14,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过嘛 他的歌声很美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the other hand, he had a tremendous singing voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.17,1:28:08.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经作古了 并交我接管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead now, and he's left me in charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.55,1:28:11.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能有点戏剧化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I can be theatrical...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.78,1:28:14.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也或许凶了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and maybe even a little rough.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.79,1:28:17.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我绝不是个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But one thing I am not...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.77,1:28:19.54,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀人凶手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a killer!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.29,1:28:23.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个艺术家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an artist.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.09,1:28:25.83,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love a good party.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.86,1:28:28.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, truce.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.04,1:28:32.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,周年庆照常举行!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commence au festival!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.26,1:28:36.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个惊喜送哥谭市民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've got a surprise for Gotham City.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.26,1:28:41.43,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天午夜我要当众洒下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At midnight, I will dump $20 million in cash...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.46,1:28:43.63,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两千万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.07,1:28:49.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心 我多的是钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about me. I've got enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.56,1:28:52.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们绝不谈条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not prepared to discuss any deals.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.45,1:28:57.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位听到了 两千万哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard it, folks, $20 million.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.29,1:28:59.83,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有余兴节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there will be entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.87,1:29:05.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生死决战 一边是我 另一边是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The big dukeroo. With me in one corner, and in the other corner...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.20,1:29:09.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给哥谭市制造恐怖的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the man who has brought real terror to Gotham City...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.91,1:29:11.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.88,1:29:13.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.85,1:29:15.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你我俩决战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.79,1:29:18.73,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空手单挑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mano y mano.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.77,1:29:21.53,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以真面目相见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have taken off my make-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.23,1:29:23.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.02,1:29:27.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you can take off yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.16,1:31:41.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.62,1:31:46.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你曾在月光下和魔鬼共舞过吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever dance with the devil by the pale moonlight?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.88,1:31:56.08,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.47,1:32:00.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走 杰克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.81,1:32:05.69,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you around, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.95,1:32:26.46,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.17,1:32:33.55,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.13,1:32:37.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me if I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.34,1:32:43.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚与过去不一样吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that wasn't just another night for either of us, was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.60,1:32:50.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 我们拥有对方是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, we both got to each other, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.98,1:32:54.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何不接受我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why won't you let me in?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.16,1:32:57.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.32,1:33:01.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我接受了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got in.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.99,1:33:08.38,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次见面我就爱上了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've loved you since I met you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.45,1:33:13.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想不透这一切 真的不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't know what to think of all this. I really don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.07,1:33:15.96,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候连我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I don't know what to think about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.99,1:33:17.88,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我势必要做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.91,1:33:19.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.67,1:33:21.81,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为没有别人能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because nobody else can.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.18,1:33:27.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我企图逃避这一切 但我没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to avoid all this, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.14,1:33:30.23,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事情就是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.68,1:33:32.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界并不完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a perfect world.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.81,1:33:35.86,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界不必非完美不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't have to be a perfect world.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.69,1:33:44.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想知道 我们是否要彼此相爱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just gotta know, are we going to try to love each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.28,1:33:49.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意一试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.16,1:33:52.38,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还在外面猖狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's out there right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.62,1:33:55.57,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得做事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've got to go to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.94,1:35:39.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上天吧 小飞人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into the air, Junior Birdman!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.34,1:35:40.95,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失手了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missed me!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.23,1:35:45.51,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧我的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Watch me!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.46,1:38:08.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点拍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them. Take the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.96,1:38:10.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥谭市民贪婪图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotham's greed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.16,1:38:41.12,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位乡亲父老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, folks...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.16,1:38:43.66,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该选最信任的人的时候了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's time for, "Who Do You Trust?"
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.69,1:38:46.82,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱钱钱呀! 你们信任谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money, money! Who do you trust?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.86,1:38:49.96,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我吗? 我无条件洒钞票呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? I'm giving away free money.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.99,1:38:54.01,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而蝙蝠侠呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where is the Batman?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.30,1:38:57.60,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他却在家里 洗丝袜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's at home, washing his tights.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.69,1:39:10.07,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大苍蝇夜空翱翔 却发现我早胸有成竹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winged battle flies through the night and finds me ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.10,1:39:12.33,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴勃 面罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob. Mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.15,1:39:15.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面罩! 戴面罩!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Masks! Put them on now!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.78,1:39:17.58,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.66,1:39:20.58,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}comes the part...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.12,1:39:23.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拯救你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where I relieve you, the little people...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.78,1:39:27.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于无意义生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the burden of your failed...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.21,1:39:28.59,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and useless lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.63,1:39:33.55,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正如我的美容师说的:"既然非死不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, as my plastic surgeon always said, "If you got to go...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.58,1:39:35.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就带着笑走"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go with a smile."
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.37,1:40:07.84,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.29,1:40:09.92,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是毒气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smylex gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.13,1:40:12.59,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要毒死大家!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to kill everybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.62,1:40:15.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上车! 上车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the car. Get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.97,1:40:24.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.71,1:42:17.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的汽球!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My balloons!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.55,1:42:29.73,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的汽球!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are my balloons!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.87,1:42:58.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他偷我的汽球!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stole my balloons!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.96,1:43:03.01,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没人告诉我 他有那玩意?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't somebody tell me he had one of those things?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.72,1:43:07.02,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴勃 枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob. Gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.23,1:43:15.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我一两分钟时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to need a minute or two alone, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.01,1:43:18.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快滚开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.37,1:44:14.34,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来呀 你这畜牲 过来呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you gruesome son of a bitch. Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.30,1:45:52.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.80,1:45:57.98,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得准时送你去教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to get you to the church on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.69,1:46:03.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.48,1:46:07.11,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥谭市大教堂 两人份交通工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotham City Cathedral. Transportation for two.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.14,1:46:10.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 马上来? - 5分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right away, sir? - Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.86,1:46:18.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还是10分钟吧 - 好的 就10分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Better make it 10. - Okay, 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.28,1:48:21.21,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到了 我们走 老兄 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's go, men, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.02,1:48:55.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们去那边 剩下的 跟我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You men go that way. Rest of you, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.12,1:49:49.59,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.21,1:50:01.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探照灯对着塔台 马上! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point those searchlights up at the tower, right now! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.91,1:50:35.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说我有点阿达的确不假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can be truly said that I have a bat in my belfry.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.05,1:50:45.89,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跳支舞吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.55,1:52:10.56,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, without you...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.60,1:52:13.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的日子怎么过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wouldn't want to go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.22,1:53:40.07,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我俩是天作之合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's as though we were made for each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.19,1:53:42.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美女与野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beauty and the Beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.06,1:53:46.02,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人当你是野兽的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, if anyone else calls you "beast"...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.05,1:53:48.37,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老子就挖出他的内脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll rip their lungs out.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.06,1:54:20.86,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丑客先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Joker?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.35,1:54:27.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说话真动听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say such beautiful things.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.36,1:54:31.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你又如此强壮有力 一身大紫!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're so powerful. And purple!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.24,1:54:36.59,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢紫色!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love purple!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.74,1:54:39.21,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.45,1:54:42.80,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可曾在月光下和魔鬼共舞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever danced with the devil in the pale moonlight?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.46,1:54:48.30,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.55,1:54:50.67,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.71,1:54:53.01,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你害的 记得吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.05,1:54:55.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我丢进硫酸中的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dropped me into that vat of chemicals!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.26,1:54:59.76,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再努力也无法忘怀这一切!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't easy to get over! And don't think that I didn't try.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.79,1:55:01.32,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.88,1:55:30.63,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了我父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.66,1:55:32.06,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.80,1:55:35.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.68,1:55:38.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我害了你 不过最初是你害我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made you, you made me first.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.51,1:55:41.45,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当初只是个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, bat-brain, I was a kid when I killed your parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.48,1:55:44.39,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说你害我 你说我害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I say I made you, you gotta say you made me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.42,1:55:46.90,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我俩真幼稚?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How childish can you get?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.94,1:55:50.16,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会打戴眼镜人吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't hit a guy with glasses on, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.83,1:56:07.97,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你笑什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.84,1:56:17.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮忙你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, let me lend you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.02,1:56:26.69,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伸出援手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lend you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.03,1:56:37.00,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在人最会偷工减料了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't make them like they used to!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.66,1:56:42.33,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙仔!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Batsy!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.76,1:56:59.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那! 在下面! 降低!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is! Down there! Go down!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.44,1:57:13.24,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该下台了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to retire.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.57,1:57:17.20,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有空随时来玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel free to drop in.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.16,1:57:29.13,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时真会笑死我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I just kill myself!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.71,1:57:34.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.21,1:57:35.64,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓稳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.43,1:59:50.94,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方已将丑客的人 一网打尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our police have rounded up all the Joker's men.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.26,1:59:53.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,犯罪组织已消灭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reign of crime is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.89,1:59:57.65,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥谭市的治安 已不再是笑柄了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Public safety in Gotham City is no longer a laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.68,2:00:00.15,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不要采访记者招待会吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you covering this press conference?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.18,2:00:01.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.32,2:00:03.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的普立兹奖呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about our Pulitzer Prize?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.99,2:00:05.70,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的事呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about us?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.32,2:00:08.75,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的蝙蝠侠照片呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your picture of Batman?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.00,2:00:18.80,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保重罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care, Allie.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.09,2:00:24.26,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们收到蝙蝠侠的信了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've received a letter from Batman this morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.72,2:00:28.35,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"请转告哥谭市民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Please inform the citizens of Gotham...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.39,2:00:31.52,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥谭市已无犯罪事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Gotham City's earned a rest from crime.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.10,2:00:35.77,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万一歹徒敢再蠢动的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if the forces of evil should rise again...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.80,2:00:38.99,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为害哥谭市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to cast a shadow on the heart of the city...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.10,2:00:40.74,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请通知我"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}call me."
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.77,2:00:45.31,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请问 如何通知他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Question. How do we call him?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.61,2:00:50.71,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要我们放出讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave us a signal.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.07,2:01:29.37,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是喝香槟比较适合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought champagne would be in order, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.40,2:01:31.04,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 阿福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.75,2:01:41.71,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韦恩先生要我转告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wayne told me to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.74,2:01:44.05,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能稍晚一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he might be a little late.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.59,2:01:49.18,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点也不觉意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a bit surprised.
